.1 及以上版本（参考安全公告 APSB26-60）。该版本修复了越界写入漏洞。在升级完成前，切勿在受影响版本中打开来源不明的 .sbsar 或模型文件，以防止恶意文件触发远程代码执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/substance3d-sampler/apsb26-60.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-34710.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-34710.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Adobe_Substance_3D_Sampler_%E8%B6%8A%E7%95%8C%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-34710.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-x35f-42cm-xjh4/GHSA-x35f-42cm-xjh4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/CNAScoreCard/blob/d2ce8041e79557a609cf010eae5b1eae3dd5bcde/web/data/cna/adobe__CNA-2009-0001.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/902c268f16bea7b5768719502584114b753f22ec/data/analyst/scripts/thr-9b7e98db89fa.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-34710"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0086","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47291","title":"Microsoft Windows HTTP.sys 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows HTTP.sys 组件存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-122），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，造成整数溢出进而演变为堆溢出，最终导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需用户交互，利用复杂度低，可被用于蠕虫式传播，建议用户立即安装 Microsoft 安全更新以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47291"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-09T17:17:34.627","updated":"2026-06-17T10:54:28.290","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 6 月安全更新，各版本修复版本号：Windows 10 1607 ≥ 10.0.14393.9234、1809 ≥ 10.0.17763.8880、21H2 ≥ 10.0.19044.7417、22H2 ≥ 10.0.19045.7417；Windows 11 23H2 ≥ 10.0.22631.7219、24H2 ≥ 10.0.26100.8655、25H2 ≥ 10.0.26200.8655、26H1 ≥ 10.0.28000.2269；Windows Server 2012/2012 R2 同步更新。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。如无法立即打补丁，建议在边界防火墙上限制对 HTTP.sys 服务（80/443 端口）的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-47291","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/1ce02d4d91174b5d6b67423908aa25f065650bbe/2026/CVE-2026-47291.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/Windows%20HTTP.sys%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2026-47291).md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.06/CVE-2026-47291%EF%BC%9AWindows%20HTTP.sys%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-47291.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-49160.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-09/TIER_3_CVE-2026-47291.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47291.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-47291/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-47291.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-15.md","https://github.com/dhmosfunk/CVE-2026-49160-CVE-2026-47291-HTTP.sys","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-47291"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0086.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0086.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0056","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-11645","title":"Google Chrome V8 越界读写漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在越界读写漏洞，该漏洞源于 V8 引擎在处理特定 JavaScript 对象时对内存边界验证不足。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，成功利用该漏洞可在沙箱环境内执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Chrome 149.0.7827.103 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Google 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-11645"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-09T00:16:47.370","updated":"2026-06-17T10:14:19.413","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 149.0.7827.103 及以上版本，该版本已修复 V8 引擎中的越界读写漏洞。若使用 Chrome 自动更新，重启浏览器后可在 chrome://settings/help 确认版本。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议在 2026 年 6 月 23 日前完成修复。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中启用安全浏览增强保护模式，并使用组策略限制用户对不可信网页的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/06/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_0153744567.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/506689381","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-11645","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-11645.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-11645.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11645.json","https://github.com/paladin316/spark-byo-secai/blob/993764caf639dcad891f72ca8b60f6f3cc98d6ba/docs/twpp/examples/Chrome-CVE-2026-11645.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2026-11645","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/0c2473c24dfecb383fdaacf2e465a9c66649856e/Intel%20Reports/thehackernews_com/2026_06_chrome-v8-zero-day-cve-2026-11645_html/link.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-11645/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2026-11645.txt","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-06-10.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2026-11645.html","https://github.com/fevar54/CVE-2026-11645-Out-of-bounds-Read-Write","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-11645","https://github.com/adamshaikhma/CVE-2026-11645","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11645"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0056.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0056.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0378","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52778","title":"YesWiki YesWiki Bazar表单计算器 不安全eval() 远程代码执行和拒绝服务漏洞","description":"YesWiki Wiki 系统的 Bazar 表单字段计算器 (CalcField.php) 存在不安全的 eval() 代码执行漏洞。该漏洞存在于 formatValuesBeforeSave() 方法中，应用尝试通过复杂的递归正则表达式验证用户定义的数学公式后再传递给 PHP eval() 函数执行。该实现存在两大架构缺陷：一是递归正则表达式 (?1)+ 依赖 PCRE 栈处理深层嵌套，攻击者可构造数千层嵌套括号的数学公式触发 PCRE 栈溢出或 ReDoS，导致 PHP-FPM 工作进程崩溃造成拒绝服务；二是验证逻辑在 tokenization 重组后才对 $formula 进行正则校验，若底层 tokenization 函数泄露意外字符串格式，或攻击者利用 PCRE 引擎边缘情况绕过正则，恶意 PHP 代码将直接经由 eval() 执行，导致远程代码执行（RCE），攻击者可获取 Web 服务器权限（如 www-data）实现完全主机沦陷。影响范围：YesWiki 4.6.6 之前版本，影响文件 tools/bazar/fields/CalcField.php。攻击条件：攻击者需具备创建或编辑 Bazar 表单并添加 Calc 字段的权限（通常为认证用户或开放注册场景）。利用方式：1) DoS：提交形如 `((((...(1+1))...)))` 含数千层嵌套括号的公式触发 PCRE 栈溢出崩溃 PHP 进程；2) RCE：若正则校验被绕过，提交 `abs(1) + system('id')` 等 PHP 代码片段经 eval() 执行实现任意命令执行。CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8 (CRITICAL)，影响机密性/完整性/可用性均为 HIGH。YesWiki 4.6.6 版本已修复，建议升级并替换 eval() 为安全的 AST 数学表达式解析器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52778","GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-08T19:16:46.683","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00.137","remediation":"立即升级 YesWiki 至 4.6.6 或更高版本，该版本已移除 CalcField.php 中通过 eval() 执行用户公式的不安全逻辑，改用专用数学表达式解析器。如暂无法升级，可临时在 Bazar 表单配置中禁用 Calc 计算字段，并严格限制具备表单创建/编辑权限的用户范围，同时检查 Web 服务器日志中是否存在异常嵌套括号或 PHP 代码注入痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/commit/dd2bd8fb099de0d21504bda8a810693b3fcb8e52","https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/releases/tag/v4.6.6","https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/security/advisories/GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2026/CVE-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52778.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/3a636e9ca4dec610ea52bddffa3cd59a180b7252/packagist/yeswiki/yeswiki/CVE-2026-52778.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2515f07573bc23c1f79f0d197a09a6f29d3e20ae/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52778.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f15100526750b2cf9bd4dc0cc587f58f968afb29/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-52778/README.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-06-08/TIER_2_CVE-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/fda1b93e4e10d8f7d6b98784e4ad319f13381845/content/posts/cve-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8/GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f55e6317cf39bbe423517d172b0edcb8b78ff702/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-52778-yeswiki-has-unsafe-eval-in-its-formula-calculato-leading-to-remote-code-execution-denial-of-service.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0092","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49975","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_http2 HTTP/2 Bomb 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_http2 模块存在内存分配大小失控漏洞（CWE-789），在处理特制 HTTP/2 请求时，未对分配的内存大小进行有效限制，导致攻击者可发送恶意构造的 HTTP/2 数据包触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.17 至 2.4.67 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，建议升级至 2.4.63 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49975"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-08T16:16:44.223","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:36.720","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.63 及以上版本，该版本修复了 mod_http2 中 HTTP/2 请求导致的内存过量分配问题。如无法立即升级，可在配置中禁用 HTTP/2 协议：在 httpd.conf 中将 Protocols 指令改为 `Protocols http/1.1`（移除 h2/h2c），或在反向代理场景中限制单个连接的最大并发流数量。对于云环境，可在 WAF 或负载均衡层面拦截过大的 HTTP/2 帧作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/06/03/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/06/08/16","https://lists.debia