Wrapper 的 GlobalDatabasePlugin 组件存在不可信搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426），低权限认证用户可通过创建特制函数，在连接集群的其他用户（包括 rds_superuser）执行该函数时触发权限提升，从而获取 rds_superuser 角色权限。该漏洞影响使用 AWS Advanced JDBC Wrapper 的 Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL 实例，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。用户需升级至 AWS Advanced JDBC Wrapper 4.0.1 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-11400","GHSA-mhww-p97m-3368"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-05T20:17:28.733","updated":"2026-06-17T10:13:59.410","remediation":"升级 AWS Advanced JDBC Wrapper 至 4.0.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 GlobalDatabasePlugin 中的不可信搜索路径问题。如无法立即升级，应限制低权限用户的函数创建权限，并审查现有自定义函数中是否存在恶意代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-039-aws/","https://github.com/aws/aws-advanced-jdbc-wrapper/releases/tag/4.0.1","https://www.cve.org/cverecord?id=CVE-2026-11400","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11400.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11400.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-11400.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/software.amazon.jdbc/aws-advanced-jdbc-wrapper/CVE-2026-11400.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-11400.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/c77d2cbba082592eae07d4a2c2470e9d0a5f1ae3/cve/CVE-2026-11400.html","https://github.com/camunda/camunda-docs/blob/cde66bbef682222275bbb095889f49d9ebe89cc3/docs/reference/notices.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-11400.json","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/42faf51f3d605826b24c8b261002a15ce5795971/memory/logs/2026-07-19.md","https://github.com/ericverret35/ops